Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.99,0:00:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making fish out of leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's a fish and this one's an octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.11,0:00:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a starfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:57.91,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1200,0)}{\fs30\c&HA1B2F3&\move(487,278,472,282)\blur1\t(\fs32)}Starfish\N{\c&H557B7E&}Bookstore
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:13.17,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial Rounded MT Bold\c&HD1CC64&\3c&H5F5E4F&\bord2\fs35\blur0.5\an7}An Illustrated\NGuide to Fish{FUCK THIS SIGN FUCK IT FUCK IT FUCK IT}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A fish book!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.03,0:01:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's salmon! They're salty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Are they just food to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.57,0:01:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look Rin, it's a flounder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.65,0:01:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A flounder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The kind that has both eyes on one side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one looks like a blowfish, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.33,0:01:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:01:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How am I cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's cheating if you cut them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.83,0:02:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just using my grownup skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all dried up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The acorn has holes in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Holes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe a bug got to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that happened to us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.39,0:02:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina threw a fit when I told her not to bring acorns in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To keep the leaves from drying up and bugs from getting out of the acorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We pressed the leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.91,0:03:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pressed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, wash your hands first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I'm leaving.
